state The life of an order
  node ●
  node Cart
  node Paid
  node ◉
  node Shipped
  node Refunded
  node Delivered
  node Returned
  ● -> Cart
  Cart -> Cart: add a product
  Cart -> Paid: pay
  Cart -> ◉: leave
  Paid -> Shipped: ship
  Paid -> Refunded: cancel
  Shipped -> Delivered: deliver
  Shipped -> Returned: refuse
  Returned -> Refunded: check the goods
  Delivered -> ◉
  Refunded -> ◉
